---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../lib/site';
---

<DocLayout
  title="Cookie notice"
  lead="TCG Vault sets no tracking or advertising cookies. It keeps a few things in your browser's storage so the site works."
  group="legal"
  updated="5 October 2026"
>
  <h2>What's stored in your browser</h2>
  <p>
    Instead of cookies, the site uses your browser's local storage. Everything there is needed for a feature you use, and
    none of it is shared with advertisers or used to follow you around the web.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>What</th><th>Why</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Sign-in session</td><td>Keeps you signed in (set by our sign-in provider, Supabase).</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Your collection</td><td>The cards you track, so it works without an account and loads fast with one.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Theme and active game</td><td>Remembers the look and the game you picked.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Marketplace cart</td><td>The cards you added, until you send the request.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Delivery details</td><td>Your shipping address or parcel locker, so you don't retype it. It only leaves this device when you send a hold request.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Draft decks and filters</td><td>Deck builder drafts and catalog preferences.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>This notice</td><td>Remembers that you have seen the cookie notice.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    Fonts come from Google Fonts and some Riftbound icons from Riot Games' servers. Loading them tells those servers your IP
    address, but they set no cookies through this site. There are no analytics, advertising or social media trackers.
  </p>

  <h2>Clearing it</h2>
  <p>
    You can delete this data at any time in your browser's settings (site data / storage). Clearing it signs you out and
    removes anything that was only stored on this device, such as a collection you never synced to an account. Because all of
    it is needed for the site to work, there are no settings to switch individual parts off.
  </p>

  <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. More about personal data in the <a href="/legal/privacy">privacy notice</a>.</p>
</DocLayout>
